        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SB3178, Large Shutter Door Door Latch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Large Window Shutter Door Lock is normally used to lock 2 shutter doors together in the closed position but it is also useful to lock other small doors on furniture or closets. It is easy to install with the included installation screws. It is made from quality solid brass material for a long lasting life. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SB3178-Specifications.gif?v=1704354554\" width=\"331\" height=\"185\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SB3178 Ball Catch Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/small-window-shutter-door-bar-latch-deltana-sb3058\"><b>Smaller Shutter Door Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Deltana SB3178  Large Shutter Door Bar\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Bar Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Locking Gap: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Pivot Plate Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Pivot Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Matching Finish Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SB3178.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SB3178 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Large Window Shutter Door Lock | Deltana SB3178",
                "description": "Large Shutter Door Door Latch Deltana SB3058 - This Large Window Shutter Door Lock is normally used to lock 2 shutter doors together in the closed position but it is also useful to lock other small doors on furniture or closets. It is easy to install with the included installation screws. It is made from quality solid brass material for a long lasting life. Available in 7 finishes.\r\n",
                "keywords": "DEL-SB3178 Large Shutter Door Bars, Deltana SB3178 7/8 Inch Solid Brass Shutter Bars, window shutter bars, window hardware,   window shutter latches,  window shutter locks, Deltana Solid Brass Large Window Shutter Door Bars, folding door latches, folding door hooks, DEL-SB3178U3, DEL-SB3178U5, DEL-SB3178U10B, DEL-SB3178U15, DEL-SB3178U15A, DEL-SB3178U26, DEL-SB3178U26D,"
